          "statement": "∀  (chunks : List (Slice U8)) (remainder : Slice U8)\n     (a b : algo.U32X4) (hs : AdlerSpec.safeLanes chunks (AdlerSpec.lane a) (AdlerSpec.lane b)),\n     algo.Adler32.compute_loop0_loop0 ⟨chunks, remainder⟩ a b ⦃ av bv =>\n       (AdlerSpec.lane av, AdlerSpec.lane bv) =\n         AdlerSpec.rawLanes chunks (AdlerSpec.lane a) (AdlerSpec.lane b) ⦄",
          "target": null,
          "theorem": "AdlerProof.inner_loop_spec"
        },
        {
